            "review_title": "Review at An Vegetarian Restaurant & Coffee",
            "review_text": "Chau D\n1 contribution\n0\nGood food, good choice\nJan 2024 • Solo\nThe food absolutely satisfied a vegetarian-preferred customer like me regarding material, tastes, odour and also price. The service, clealiness, vibe were pleasant. The staff were way better and more friendly than the majority of surrounding stores I had visited. Therefore I would say that my experience here deserve my payment.\nWritten March 27, 2024",
