            "review_title": "Review at An Vegetarian Restaurant & Coffee",
            "review_text": "DivePanther\nPortsmouth, United Kingdom138 contributions\n0\nMy go-to District 7 restaurant\nNov 2019\nLife changed permanently - and for the better - when An Restaurant opened a few months ago. You could probably describe the food as contemporary Vietnamese vegetarian with some Thai influence. We eat here regularly and I've been happy with every dish I've tried (with the exception of the tacos). Fresh fruit juices and smoothies are also good. I haven't even tried any of the teas yet. No doubt I'll be here next Sunday morning as usual.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 22, 2019",
